  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">雞事</span></span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span>藍春瑞</h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjwpJboruS3uoz6Y0gJL99qnlwldquIxRY5bUzJROWzHz3aZsrz3iDcIYgWQGkEoooS3VXu03rP9y03Y6CAwYQMv3Npwy7z35EqBpj87H_Ld9vsXisBS527k1H1T1NxVOjYerGB2c9V5tY23jvsBJLFFqkFvYdEOlOjGUpm9AeVi3rUXbjeXJ9m120BqvgU\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjwpJboruS3uoz6Y0gJL99qnlwldquIxRY5bUzJROWzHz3aZsrz3iDcIYgWQGkEoooS3VXu03rP9y03Y6CAwYQMv3Npwy7z35EqBpj87H_Ld9vsXisBS527k1H1T1NxVOjYerGB2c9V5tY23jvsBJLFFqkFvYdEOlOjGUpm9AeVi3rUXbjeXJ9m120BqvgU\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgTB9_fGkmwIJRx_roqXu5eDCZDKIY4ewgwI_AA8pm5COygWA83aJugl3Wotd0ctWlAjknToATYFAHxDMbgskMgdYXczz6CIIRBnakjadf6kPj1o0LFRZBQ4J_2_z7yAIXbmgsMlhSECnSpLf7Dwjf02F_87B5Z3-rOSs_YKwn2cFYlb5u7oVurGwsOLk-h\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgTB9_fGkmwIJRx_roqXu5eDCZDKIY4ewgwI_AA8pm5COygWA83aJugl3Wotd0ctWlAjknToATYFAHxDMbgskMgdYXczz6CIIRBnakjadf6kPj1o0LFRZBQ4J_2_z7yAIXbmgsMlhSECnSpLf7Dwjf02F_87B5Z3-rOSs_YKwn2cFYlb5u7oVurGwsOLk-h=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></span></div></div></div></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>早起去游泳池泅水，到10點thóng ê時tsūn，tsiah想著雞仔iáu未hē飼料kah水hōo食，無khà koh換ta衫，身軀tâm-tâm就nǹg入去駛車，拚tńg來到厝，人to未落車耳空就聽著三隻狗仔吠kah大細聲，kah閒時無啥sio-siāng，踏過草phí行四、五hua̍h了後，隨看著lang-lang ê樹仔跤有黃黃花花ê烏影leh tín動，正經是吠真--ê，m̄是亂使來--ê，緊mé tsông到位kā斟酌看，一隻雞公tshuā兩隻雞母tng-leh樹仔跤tshíng塗沙。我無kā in拍生驚，liam跤行去雞tiâu邊攑hôo魚仔有鬥柄ê網仔iap tī kha-tshng後，tuì上近ê hit兩隻母--ê kā khap--落-去，聽著兩聲「kok…kok」就掠--著--ah。一手一隻tuì翼股kā tsang-kuân，向tshian-tshian tuì雞tiâu仔內kā khian--入-去。翻頭se̍h tńg來樹仔跤，仝款ê步數，一下手就koh khap著另外hit隻khah大phiāng ê雞公，趕緊koh kā放入去雞tiâu仔內了後，規粒pho̍k-pho̍k-tshíng ê心肝tsiah tńg冗--落-來。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>食暗飽，khat番麥角beh去飼雞仔，倒飼料ê時，tī雞槽仔邊有khû一隻kha-tshng斗比平素時ke hai tsiânn濟ê雞母，kā趕mā lóng無leh hiù--我，伸跤kā pué，伊mā m̄徙位。Ànn落去斟酌看，tī尾脽hia tiâu一粒hōo白膜仔包--著ê卵，koh有kânn淡薄仔血絲tī頂頭，應該是卵tuann tiâu tī kha-tshng頭生bē落--來leh艱苦。Tann真正是生目睭m̄ bat看過目眉，頭殼內隨想著若無kā tsit粒卵生--落-來，雞母就親像古早ê查某人拄著坦橫生仝款，tsit聲就穩死--ê。M̄-koh我是hē老本飼雞仔ê主人家，bē-sái目睭金金看伊勼tī塗跤leh艱苦，定著ài想一个步數來tháu tsit个kat，臨時臨iāu就脹膽tham落去sa雞母ê翼股，好禮仔kā kha-tshng頭ê白膜仔thí--開，卵suah家己輾落來塗跤、kho̍k著石頭。好佳哉kan-na外殼破一空仔niā-niā，我暢一下緊kā雞母放--開，lâ-lûn燒ê卵khioh tī手蹄內iáu好好無破--去。想bē到雞母kah卵lóng平安順風，正經是土地公有保庇，若無，就害了了。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Beh暗仔有小可反冷，有想beh開電火hōo規陣雞仔kheh燒，順suà算一下仔總計有幾隻，m̄-koh連suà áu幾若改tsíng頭仔，khah算就是減一隻，即時hiu阿華講koh suan一隻去--ah。攑魚網仔beh出來揣ê時，翻頭koh se̍h入去算，mā是減一隻，tann頭看鐵網仔頂kuân七里香發kah tsiânn旺ê葉ue內底，bih一隻雞母leh nah涼。伊lóng m̄出聲應話，差一絲仔就害我刣椅仔sa̍h柴kia̍h，規日bē得清心。</div></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：https://reurl.cc/893GYM）</span></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh